flowchart TD
    Signal[Per-turn ingest signal<br/>Redis Stream] --> Worker[Ingest worker<br/>N-turn batching · inactivity timer]
    Worker -->|reads after the cursor only| Chatlog[(Source chatlog store<br/>the single source of conversation text<br/>— never replicated into the service DB)]
    Chatlog --> Extract[Memory-extraction LLM<br/>called per N-turn batch<br/>4.6x saving on fixed prompt cost]
    Extract --> Gate{Extraction gate<br/>independent judge LLM<br/>attribution & novelty check}
    Gate -->|pass| Store[(PostgreSQL + pgvector<br/>memories · change ledger · cursor)]
    Gate -->|reject| Reject[Rejected candidates logged<br/>for over-suppression review · 30-day TTL]
    Store --> Cursor[Advance cursor<br/>held back on failure → idempotent retries]
    Sweep[Retention sweep worker<br/>TTL expiry · source-deletion propagation] -.periodic.-> Store

